# plotPole 3: Time series for plotting                                                       #
#                                                                                            #
# > % < Use values from Bernese formatted GCC files                                          # USE_ERPFIL
# > % < Use values directly from ADDNEQ2 output                                              # USE_OUTFIL
#                                                                                            #
#     Filename           line numbers    color         symbol        size      label         #
# 0.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  (reference for difference)                            # ERPFIL_0 READLINE_0
# 1.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_1 READLINE_1 COLOR_1 SYMBOL_1 SSIZE_1 LABEL_1
# 2.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_2 READLINE_2 COLOR_2 SYMBOL_2 SSIZE_2 LABEL_2
# 3.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_3 READLINE_3 COLOR_3 SYMBOL_3 SSIZE_3 LABEL_3
# 4.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_4 READLINE_4 COLOR_4 SYMBOL_4 SSIZE_4 LABEL_4
# 5.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_5 READLINE_5 COLOR_5 SYMBOL_5 SSIZE_5 LABEL_5
# 6.> %%%%%%%%%%%% <     > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%%%%%%% <  > %%% <   > %%%%%%%% <    # ERPFIL_6 READLINE_6 COLOR_6 SYMBOL_6 SSIZE_6 LABEL_6
#                                                                                            #
#     Filename          GNSS-sepc.            Filename          GNSS-sepc.                   #
#   > %%%%%%%%%%%% <     (one for several system-sep. estimates)                             # OUTFIL_0
